{"id":"n58274-2-7","stage":1,"title":"아무것 · 一点","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58274-2-7-1","ko":"어제 저녁에 뭐 했어?","zh":"昨天晚上你做了什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁에","audio":"/audio/adc9d30ae9de01c054e6.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"했어?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e7bac525d7f0dca5b3d0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58274-2-7-2","ko":"피곤해서 아무것도 못하고 잤어.","zh":"太累了，什么都没做，直接睡觉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"피곤해서","meaning":"疲倦，疲惫，困","explanation":"피곤하다：疲倦，疲惫，困；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"피곤하다","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60291","senseId":"1","lemma":"피곤하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피곤해서","audio":"/audio/a086f731b495089eb521.mp3"}},{"text":"아무것도","meaning":"一点，什么","explanation":"아무것：一点，什么；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아무것","audio":"/audio/5e19fcc44c9431450d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58274","senseId":"2","lemma":"아무것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무것도","audio":"/audio/7fe97b694951cb3ea1a4.mp3"}},{"text":"못하고","meaning":"做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）","explanation":"못하다：做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91168","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못하고","audio":"/audio/bbda0844b5912bbb5411.mp3"}},{"text":"잤어.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잤어","audio":"/audio/0570fa583804e5424f3e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"69e26389ae2a6e2f","term":"피곤하다","zh":"疲倦，疲惫，困","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3","entryId":"60291","definition":"身体或心里觉得累而筋疲力尽。","pronunciation":["피곤하다"]},{"id":"5e19fcc44c943145","term":"아무것","zh":"一点，什么","audio":"/audio/5e19fcc44c9431450d98.mp3","entryId":"58274","definition":"某物的一点点或一部分。","pronunciation":["아ː무